    </bannerImage>
        <bannerTitle>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Blog Details]]></Value>
    </bannerTitle>
                        <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "ec6f0cb4-b95b-4501-960e-36903c5916c2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "At Centro, corporate responsibility goes far beyond the boardroom. Our commitment to creating lasting impact has led us to a powerful new initiative, one that turns our team members into first responders and active community protectors.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a landmark collaboration with the <strong>Egyptian Red Crescent</strong>, a select group of Centroees has undergone intensive emergency medical training that extends well beyond basic first aid. This hands-on program, led by certified EMTs, equipped our team with critical life-saving skills, including <strong>CPR, emergency patient stabilization, wound care, and AED (Automated External Defibrillator) operation</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The training wasn’t theoretical, it was grounded in real-life case simulations using professional-grade medical equipment. Every session was designed to prepare participants for real emergencies, both within the workplace and in the communities we serve.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000009",
      "key": "7dace581-c6d3-4234-b935-ad5248386d78",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Now certified to deliver emergency care at the scene and during hospital transport, our employees stand ready to act when every second counts."
        },
        {
          "alias": "attribution",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "38651cb5-a3cb-4e3b-92f4-32692d277f25",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This Egyptian Red Crescent-accredited certification reflects more than just skills; it’s a symbol of empowerment, resilience, and responsibility. Our trained team members now form a reliable, internal line of defense in case of health emergencies and a trusted support system for the wider public.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "2ecc9515-0a77-4162-b338-d7248bbae3f3",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "About Centro"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h3\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "f1a9e062-9947-40e8-92e6-30b4d8e7fd15",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Centro</strong> is a global leader in business and technology consulting, delivering impactful solutions across <strong>Business Process Outsourcing (BPO)</strong>, <strong>Digital Transformation</strong>, and <strong>Healthcare</strong>. With a presence spanning <strong>North America, Asia, the Middle East, and Africa</strong>, Centro is trusted by clients worldwide to deliver customized, results-driven services.<br>Learn more at <a href=\"http://www.centrocdx.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">www.centrocdx.com</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "f85d4dd8-f414-4663-b741-f53b6c87dc06",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "About the Egyptian Red Crescent"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h3\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "4eef3fb5-15c0-45bb-a353-610900ecbc33",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <strong>Egyptian Red Crescent</strong> is Egypt’s leading humanitarian organization, providing emergency medical services and support in times of crisis. As part of the global Red Cross/Red Crescent network, it mobilizes trained volunteers and professionals to deliver aid, reduce suffering, and build stronger, more resilient communities.<br>For more information, visit <a href=\"http://www.egyptianrc.org\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">www.egyptianrc.org</a>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [],
  "expose": [
